<title>USA: TENNIS-OAKLAND WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-OAKLAND WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>OAKLAND, California 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$450,000 Bank of the West Classic women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>1-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat Kim Po (U.S.) 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>5-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat 2-Lindsay</p>
<p>Davenport (U.S.) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) 6-2</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
